WEBVTT

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:05.080
All right! Smile, Uzuki!

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:07.290
Perfect! That's beautiful!

00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:10.380
Cat ears are meow.

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:13.420
Huh? No way. Rock's now.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:14.410
Cat ears.

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:15.520
Rock.

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:17.240
Cat ears.

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:18.390
Rock.

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:20.010
Cat ears.

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:21.140
Rock.

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:22.140
There they go again.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.700
Cat ears.

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:26.460
Those two really don't work as a unit.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:24.860
Rock.

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:26.820
Cat ears.

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:30.650
Their images are complete opposites.

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:28.760
Rock.

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:34.150
What's Producer thinking, anyway?

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:36.150
Cat ears.

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:38.030
Rock.

00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:12.330
A <i>unit</i> debut?!

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:14.340
Yes.

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:16.430
You mean, like, "<i>us</i>"?

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:17.960
Yes.

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:20.300
Why?! No way!

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:23.610
Yeah, seriously! It's never gonna work!

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:24.890
Is that right?

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:35.420
I want to be a cute and pop cat-eared idol.

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:39.790
So rock can kiss meow behind!

00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:44.700
W-Well, cat ears can kiss <i>my</i> behind!

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:45.880
Hmph!

00:02:49.550 --> 00:02:52.710
We've already
composed a song for you.

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:04.220
I intended to ask about your unit's image
before proceeding with lyrics.

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:05.640
Do you have one in mind?

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:11.160
That song meowds a cat ears dance!

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:14.350
It'll be cooler as rock!

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:17.450
Meow way! It'll be cuter with cat ears!

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:18.460
You think it'll work out?

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:20.810
I sure hope so.

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:28.580
The cute design and pop colors
will make mew swoon!

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:33.000
The spicy sting of that mint
rocks my rockin' soul.

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:38.390
Nothing beats the cool, minty freshness
after shouting through a jam session!

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:40.810
One lick, and meowr girl power'll go off the charts!

00:03:42.850 --> 00:03:47.240
No one's gonna fall in love with
the product if we don't get in sync.

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:49.180
We need to push the cuteness.

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:50.920
What are you talking about?

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:53.270
It's <i>cool</i>, and that's what matters.

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:54.310
Cute.

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:55.130
Cool.

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:56.270
Cute.

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:57.600
Cool.

00:03:57.600 --> 00:03:59.780
Cute!

00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:05.280
We'd like a "best friends"
image in this shoot.

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:08.200
Please choose your clothes
from that rack.

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:08.910
Sure!

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:15.830
So? What'dya think?

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:17.820
What're mew <i>thinking</i>?!

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:20.350
Get some cat ears and
a tail and match meow!

00:04:20.350 --> 00:04:21.880
Why <i>me</i>?

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:23.410
Why don't <i>you</i> match <i>me</i>?

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:24.360
What?!

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:26.340
Are mew <i>deaf</i>?! "Best friends"!

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:33.180
All right, girls. Good job.

00:04:34.260 --> 00:04:39.650
Miku and Riina have been working
and taking lessons together a lot lately.

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:44.590
They're working on their teamwork
before their CD debut.

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:47.030
But they start fighting every five minutes.

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:50.610
They really want to work that badly?

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:52.330
Wow.

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:54.540
Shoot.

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:58.920
Why'd Producer put
those two together, anyway?

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:03.450
I'm sure he has good reason.

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:05.230
Why not ask P?

00:05:05.230 --> 00:05:06.820
I'll go ask him now!

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:08.130
Me too! Me too!

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:23.110
"Idol Fes"?!

00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:24.720
You mean like a huge concert?!

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:26.930
Wow! Is everyone gonna be in it?

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:29.870
It is still in the planning stages.

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:32.810
We will announce it in time.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:34.870
Please do not tell anyone about it.

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:36.540
"Idol Fes"?!

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:39.290
Yeah! That's what it said!

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:43.700
Wow! We'll all be on stage together!

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:48.340
It's meow chance to meowke
cat ears all the rage!

00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:51.220
It's my chance to show everyone
the awesomeness of rock!

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:57.350
You guys just can't get along, huh?

00:05:57.350 --> 00:06:01.390
But we'll be participating as units, right?

00:06:01.390 --> 00:06:06.340
If Miku and Riina don't get their
act together, they might not go on.

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:09.430
What? It won't be all of us?

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:11.660
...Th-They wouldn't...

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:13.490
...But maybe...

00:06:37.970 --> 00:06:39.560
P, no meowre!

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:40.820
This unit isn't working!

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:42.350
Give me a solo debut!

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:46.960
Why'd you put us together, anyway?

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:50.110
Did you just slap us together
because we were left over?

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:53.630
Not at all.

00:06:53.630 --> 00:06:55.990
I believe that your unit
has good chemistry.

00:06:58.400 --> 00:06:59.800
No way!

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:04.860
If you believe that it will not work,
we can make some adjustments.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:09.340
However, one of your debuts
will be delayed until further notice.

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:11.310
Not good.

00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:14.550
At this rate, one of us
might not perform in the event.

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:16.540
No way! Now what?!

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:18.310
I'm definitely going on!

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:20.870
Well, so am I!

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:21.850
Is something the matter?

00:07:22.720 --> 00:07:26.240
W-We thought about it,
and meowbe a unit isn't so bad.

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:28.170
Meowbe we'll give it ameowther shot.

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:29.960
Yeah, yeah! Another shot!

00:07:29.960 --> 00:07:33.130
I mean, we don't know
each other that well yet.

00:07:33.130 --> 00:07:35.690
Yeah! We haven't really had
a chance to commeownicate!

00:07:35.690 --> 00:07:38.030
Why not try living together?

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:42.660
I live with my sister,
and we get along really well!

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:44.550
That's a great idea!

00:07:44.550 --> 00:07:46.830
Miku lives in the dorms,

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:49.730
so Riina could sleep over.

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:52.670
Nywow! Soun's li'e fun!

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:56.890
It may be worth trying.

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:01.310
Meow!

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:03.570
What's with all that stuff?!

00:08:03.570 --> 00:08:07.650
I just packed up a week's worth of stuff.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:10.650
Mew didn't have to
bring meowr whole house!

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:13.280
Hey, I killed myself trying to cut down!

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:20.240
Hey, this place is kinda rockin'.

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:26.460
I only have one bed,
so I'll put down a futon for you.

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:27.880
Oh, sure.

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:31.390
What's in these boxes, anyway?

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:34.510
What's with all the headphones?!

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:36.120
Oh, those?

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:37.750
It's my collection.

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:39.790
One's meowre than enough!

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:42.430
You've got a ton of cat ears, don't you?

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:44.520
I meowd them for work!

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:46.190
Same difference.

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:51.430
Don't stick meowr posters on meow wall!

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:53.400
Huh? Why not?

00:08:57.020 --> 00:08:59.070
It's meowrning! Wake up, sleepyhead!

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:06.080
I don't usually eat breakfast.

00:09:06.510 --> 00:09:08.420
Breakfast is the source
of meowr day's energy!

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:10.000
Meow, hurry up, eat,
and let's head off to school!

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:13.600
Wh-What the heck!? Worcester?!

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:15.250
You put soy sauce on eggs! <i>Soy sauce</i>!

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:19.210
Soy sauce?! Heresy! It's Worcester!

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:19.210
Soy!

00:09:19.210 --> 00:09:19.960
Worcester!

00:09:19.960 --> 00:09:20.990
Soy!

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:22.310
Worcester!

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:31.120
The cafeteria closes at eight.

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:34.070
We're late, so we'll hit the
supermeowrket before homeow.

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:36.280
Oh, sure.

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:41.410
Everything in the deli section
is 50 yen off at this hour. It's great.

00:09:41.770 --> 00:09:43.520
You eat that much?

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:45.710
An idol's body is her only asset.

00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:49.670
I try to get at least 30 different dishes
to keep meow meals balanced.

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:57.800
This bath is awesome.

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:01.570
I'm done, so I'll leave first.

00:10:01.570 --> 00:10:05.320
Mew aren't done yet! Count to 100!

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:08.640
What? Do you <i>have</i> to fuss about everything?

00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:13.630
Miku, good even.

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:15.940
Is the bath crowded right now?

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:17.800
Meow, it's empty!

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:20.270
Thank ye.

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:21.500
See you later.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:22.820
Have fun meow!

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:30.630
Was that Kobayakawa Sae
and Kohinata Miho?

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:33.710
Like, super popular idols,
just casually walking around?

00:10:34.010 --> 00:10:36.770
Oh, so you're a fan?

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:38.010
No way!

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:42.260
Them walking around
all natural-like was just kinda rockin'.

00:10:42.260 --> 00:10:46.140
Meowr "rockin'" is starting
to sound like an excuse!

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:47.180
What? How?!

00:10:49.740 --> 00:10:52.330
I'm Tada Riina from 346 Productions.

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:54.200
I wanna be a rockin' cool idol.

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:57.110
I love rock more than
anyone in the world!

00:10:57.110 --> 00:10:58.570
I hope you'll consider me!

00:11:04.150 --> 00:11:05.500
Done already meow?

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:06.530
How'd it go?

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:09.370
Okay, I guess.

00:11:12.390 --> 00:11:13.940
Relax meow.

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:15.420
I'll bet mew got the part.

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:18.500
I'll put on meow cat ears
and try meow best for it too!

00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:22.860
Yeah, you can do it, Miku.

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:24.300
Number three, please.

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:25.580
C-Coming!

00:11:28.260 --> 00:11:30.730
It's gonna be a while, huh?

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:33.240
Meow nerves are killing meow!

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:36.360
Mew go home without meow.

00:11:43.460 --> 00:11:46.370
I'm homeow. And beat.

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:48.220
Welcome home.

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:51.570
What're you doing?

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:55.580
I thought you might be
bored of the deli section,

00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:57.230
so I made enough for two.

00:11:57.230 --> 00:11:59.610
Riina, mew can cook?

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:00.340
Well, kinda.

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:04.510
It smells great!

00:12:04.510 --> 00:12:05.760
What's on the meownu?

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:09.560
Braised flounder.

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:13.550
It's like my best dish.

00:12:13.550 --> 00:12:15.700
...I'll be done in a minute, so just wait—

00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:17.020
Huh? What's up?

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:22.150
Meow!

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:24.900
I can't stand fish, mew clod!

00:12:24.310 --> 00:12:26.050
...What?! But cat ears—

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:27.990
Why would cat ears mean I like fish?!

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:30.160
Why couldn't you
braise beef or something?!

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:31.240
What the heck?

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:33.070
Who do you think I made this for?

00:12:49.590 --> 00:12:53.060
I only made it 'cuz
...I thought you'd like fish...

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:04.560
I'm sorry I exploded on mew earlier.

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:07.640
Can I meowke it up to mew
with this jumbo mint candy?

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:09.530
Sorry, no thanks.

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:12.550
I can't handle mint.
It's too spicy for me.

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:15.290
But you said the spicy sting
rocks your soul!

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:17.640
I was just advertising.

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:19.470
Plain sweet's the way to go.

00:13:19.470 --> 00:13:21.280
How's that rockin'?!

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:24.300
It's rockin' 'cuz I think it's rockin'!

00:13:25.300 --> 00:13:29.960
No, I'm telling you,
rock comes from the heart.

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:33.390
Without a heart burning with passion,
you won't get any fans.

00:13:33.890 --> 00:13:38.180
Idols are great because just looking at them gives mew
such a huge dose of cute that you can't help but feel happy!

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:40.020
That's why we meowd cat ears!

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:42.880
Cat ears don't really work with rock.

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:45.630
We need to rock out on
...guitars with riffs from the soul—

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:48.740
Meowbe mew can play
some riffs for us, then!

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:53.490
...I-I'm still learning, so...

00:13:53.490 --> 00:13:55.930
Why'd mew bring one
if mew can't play it?!

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:57.250
I said I'm learning!

00:13:57.250 --> 00:13:59.420
...Now, now, you guys...

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:01.910
...Please don't fight...

00:14:00.220 --> 00:14:01.910
That still means mew can't play it!

00:14:01.910 --> 00:14:05.870
I thought they might get along better
...if they lived together, but...

00:14:01.910 --> 00:14:04.660
Not now, but I'll be able to soon!

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:06.360
And when's "soon"?

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:08.170
Nothing's really changed.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:08.170
W-Well, um, maybe in...

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:09.960
Yeah.

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:13.310
I'm fine.

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:15.700
I told you, you don't have to call.

00:14:16.970 --> 00:14:20.440
Don't worry. I'm fine.

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:22.750
Yeah.

00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:25.190
Night, Mom.

00:14:43.170 --> 00:14:45.040
Event Promoter

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:47.080
Idols who can sing?

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:47.800
Yes.

00:14:49.170 --> 00:14:54.770
We have an event in two days, but the idol unit
that was scheduled to perform had to cancel.

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:54.770
What's up?

00:14:54.770 --> 00:15:03.170
We were wondering if perhaps 346 Productions
might be able to provide a stand-in.

00:15:05.810 --> 00:15:07.110
My sincere apologies.

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:09.480
...We understand that it is urgent, but—

00:15:09.480 --> 00:15:10.230
...Um...

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:14.620
Could we do that event?

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:20.870
Why'd you do that?
We've never sung together before!

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:23.110
I'm sorry.

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:26.880
I just didn't want to
pass up an opportunity.

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:28.350
An opportunity?

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:33.120
We still haven't gotten in sync.

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:37.300
I want to perform at Idol Fes.

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:42.890
But not if it means going on
as a unit that's bound to fail.

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:48.900
I want to see why
our producer put us together.

00:15:49.910 --> 00:15:53.190
...If it doesn't work out, then...

00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:56.950
Riina, you debut before me.

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:02.910
The event is in two days.

00:16:04.470 --> 00:16:07.660
The song does not yet have lyrics.

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:08.790
...Th-That's...

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:13.350
So we have two days to write them?

00:16:13.350 --> 00:16:14.680
Riina?

00:16:14.680 --> 00:16:17.090
I'm kinda interested in writing lyrics.

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:20.800
And I feel the same way.

00:16:25.480 --> 00:16:27.690
So you will do it?

00:16:28.110 --> 00:16:29.320
Yes.

00:16:29.850 --> 00:16:31.380
Very well.

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:34.860
I will have costumes
and accompaniment rushed.

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:39.080
Please have lyrics ready
by the morning of the event.

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:40.240
Okay!

00:16:59.930 --> 00:17:03.310
"Burning heartbeat rock you!"

00:17:03.310 --> 00:17:04.120
"Kiss you!"

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:06.580
"The cold rains of sadness dampen the town."

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:10.580
"The time to paint the night with
...the color of my rockin' soul is now"...

00:17:12.620 --> 00:17:14.840
What?! You wanna start something?

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:16.870
Do <i>you</i> have anything?

00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:17.610
Of course!

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:23.320
"Meow, meow, purr-purr, meow."

00:17:23.320 --> 00:17:26.370
"Here to give you a lovely smile, meow."

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:28.000
Um, what?

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.840
At least it's better than yours!

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:32.260
What happened to being
interested in writing lyrics?

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:34.380
You expect me to sing
yours with a straight face?!

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:42.300
Here, soy sauce.

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:44.020
Thanks.

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:03.930
We bring you the source of great power!

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:05.870
Have the snack.

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:07.660
Anya-meow! Ranko!

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:08.620
